items.BHP_CycleHammer.description=An advanced Builder’s Hammer with expanded functionality.\nCycle Mode\n\nPrimary: Cycle block group forward\nSecondary: Cycle block group backward\nHold Primary/Secondary: AOE block cycling\n\nAbility 1: Cycle to next Hammer mode\n\n<i>(Tip: Hold 'Q' (your 'Select Block From Set' keybind) while holding a block to swap through the block's block set.)<i>

items.BHP_RotateHammer.description=An advanced Builder’s Hammer with expanded functionality.\nRotate Mode\n\nPrimary: Rotate block clockwise\nSecondary: Rotate block counter-clockwise\nHold Primary/Secondary: AOE block rotation\n\nAbility 1: Cycle to next Hammer mode\n\n<i>(Tip: Hold 'Q' (your 'Select Block From Set' keybind) while holding a block to swap through the block's block set.)<i>

items.BHP_StateHammer.description=An advanced Builder’s Hammer with expanded functionality.\nState Mode\n\nPrimary: Cycle block state forward\nSecondary: Cycle block state backward\nHold Primary/Secondary: AOE block state change\n\nAbility 1: Cycle to next Hammer mode\n\n<i>(Tip: Hold 'Q' (your 'Select Block From Set' keybind) while holding a block to swap through the block's block set.)<i>